<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bonds close higher, await Us rate news.</title>
<headline>Belgian bonds close higher, await Us rate news.</headline>
<text>
<p>1545 GMT - OLOs built on opening gains to close higher in line with Bunds, as the market waited for news of the US FOMC meeting on rates. </p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.72% (5.73) BE286=, 7 bps over Bunds (7)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.20 at 121.51 BGBc1 ;Mark/Bfr 20.6310/20(20.6320/35</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.24/30% (26/29), 1-wk repo 3.32/35 (33/37)  TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
